#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# unequal

#% text
# `unequal(a, b)`, written `a != b`, gives `true` or `false` when it can be decided, and stays symbolic otherwise.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
1 != 2
#% output
#= true

#% cell
1 != 1.0
#% output
#= false

#% cell
x != y
#% output
#= x != y

